---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { inferenceStates } from '../../content/inference';
const swatches = [{name:'Paper',hex:'#F5F1E8'},{name:'Ink',hex:'#17211B'},{name:'Leaf lime',hex:'#D6EB77'},{name:'Cobalt',hex:'#2448C6'},{name:'Coral',hex:'#F58B70'}];
---
<Base title="Local design review — Sudharsana"><div class="wrap design-page">
  <p class="eyebrow">Design package · version 01</p><h1>A playful studio for<br/><em>serious engineering.</em></h1>
  <p>This local package makes the proposed direction tangible: a responsive homepage, one complete work story, a typography and color system, original illustrations, and every inference sketch state.</p>
  <p class="review-status">Awaiting design and factual approval. This package is not a production release.</p>
  <div class="design-links"><a class="button" href="/">Explore the homepage ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/work/ai-chat/">Read the complete story ↗</a></div>
  <section class="design-block"><h2>The palette</h2><div class="swatches">{swatches.map(color => <div class="swatch"><div class="swatch-color" style={`background:${color.hex}`}></div><p>{color.name}<br/>{color.hex}</p></div>)}</div><p class="small-note">Paper and ink set the tone. Lime and coral carry illustrations. Cobalt makes actions and focus visible.</p></section>
  <section class="design-block"><h2>The type</h2><div class="type-samples"><div><p class="eyebrow">Space Grotesk · 400 / 600</p><h3>Clear thinking.<br/>Useful systems.</h3><p>Body copy at 18px, with space to read. Headings are confident; the words do the work.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Instrument Serif · italic</p><h3><em>Curiosity, with intention.</em></h3><p>Used for a few expressive words, leaving the main narrative clear and direct.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="design-block"><h2>The inference sketch</h2><p>Three native radio choices. Each deliberate change animates once, then stops. Reduced motion is immediate. All explanations are available without JavaScript.</p><div class="design-links">{inferenceStates.map(state => <a class="text-link" href={`/design/states/${state.id}/`}>{state.label} ↗</a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="design-block"><h2>What needs your review</h2><ul class="review-list"><li>The overall direction, desktop/mobile composition, and illustration style.</li><li>The headline, AI systems focus, first-person voice, and personal interests implied by the copy.</li><li>Use of the existing portrait and the full name “Sudharsana Rajasekaran.”</li><li>The career paragraph, drawn from the older portfolio. It deliberately avoids a current job title.</li><li>Your contribution and decision descriptions in the complete AI chat story and the other work previews.</li></ul><p class="small-note">The two remaining work stories, production metadata, security/release configuration, and final acceptance checks follow approval. Remote pushes and cloud actions need the separate approvals described in the plan.</p></section>
</div></Base>
